description	"Admiral Natasi Daala

Scorched Earth Commander with experimental equipment and an aggressive playstyle.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Experimental Singularity Pistol (3)
-- Pulls on hit
-- 65% more damage/50% more FP drain
-- 30% faster velocity
-- 45% slower RoF/25% slower reload
- Nerve Gas Emitter (4)
-- Sonic Grenade
-- Poisons/Burns/Cripples on hit
-- Reduced Splash Radius
-- 20 Additional Splash Damage
- Immolation Grenade (2)
-- Fire Grenade
-- Flashes/Cripples on hit
-- Increased Splash Radius
-- 35 Additional Splash Damage
- Quickthrow Grav-Charge (4)
-- Frag Grenade
-- Pulls/Cripples on det
-- 0 Damage, Increased Alt-Fire Splash Radius

^5Powers::
- Warlord's Rage (Rage 3)

^8Attributes:
- Anti-MT (2)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (3)
- Hot-Headed (Fury 2)
- Rally
- Stat Viewer
- Tracking Beacon
- Dexterity (1)
- Knockdown Roll

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Quick Throw (3) ^3[CS2]
- Dash (1) ^3[CS3]
- Gunkick ^3[CS4]
- Lead Through Fear (Force Dispenser 3) ^3[USE In Melee]"
